@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@botKey = PASTE_BOT_API_KEY

### ===== แอดมิน =====

### Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/bots/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List bots
GET {{baseUrl}}/bots
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Register bot + issue key (apiKey แสดงครั้งเดียว)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "id": "bot-01",
  "name": "Midasbuy Bot 01",
  "deviceName": "PC-01"
}

### Rotate key (คีย์เก่าใช้ไม่ได้ทันที)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/bot-01/api-key
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Revoke key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bots/bot-01/api-key
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Command restart bot-01 (ผู้สั่งมาจาก token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/bot-01/commands
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "command": "restart"
}

### Update code all bots
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "version": "1.0.1"
}

### Kill-switch on
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/kill-switch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enabled": true
}

### Latest code package (ยังไม่อัปโหลดได้ package: null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bots/packages/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Upload zip then update all bots (เก็บไฟล์ ไม่รันบนเซิร์ฟเวอร์)
# แนบไฟล์ .zip ของตัวเองแทนบรรทัดไฟล์ด้านล่าง ถ้าจะอัปเดตเครื่องเดียวให้เพิ่ม field botId = bot-01
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----botpack

------botpack
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="version"

1.0.1
------botpack
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="bot-pack.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./bot-pack.zip
------botpack--

### Bot command logs (botId ได้จาก GET /bots)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bots/bot-01/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Kill-switch off
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/kill-switch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "enabled": false
}

### ===== บอท =====

### Heartbeat from local bot (botId มาจากคีย์)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json
x-bot-key: {{botKey}}

{
  "cpuPercent": 12.5,
  "memoryPercent": 40,
  "uptimeSeconds": 120
}
